        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Work schedules of employees assigned to sleeper-cab runs may vary from day to day while on the run. The work schedule of employees assigned to sleeper-cab runs also may vary when the employees are assigned to the Plant.",
            "block_bbox": [
